=The deal reached the proposal stage, but no proposal was sent because:

{{ $('Validate and price deal').item.json.problems.map(p => '- ' + p).join('\n') }}

Fix the deal in HubSpot: {{ $('Validate and price deal').item.json.dealUrl }}
Then set its Status to Retry in the proposal log so the next run picks it up.
